<title>HONG KONG: Dacom Corp sets US$50 mln FRN.</title>
<headline>Dacom Corp sets US$50 mln FRN.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue was announced by arranger Daiwa Securities Hong Kong.</p>
<p>BORROWER DACOM CORPORATION</p>
<p> AMOUNT   US$50 MLN    COUPON     6ML+60 BP  MATURITY  5 YRS</p>
<p> TYPE     FRN	    ISS PRICE  99.85	LAUNCH    14.FEB.97</p>
<p> PUTS     NONE	   CALLS	NONE	 REPLIES   17.FEB.97</p>
<p> LISTING  LUXEMBOURG   REPAYMENT  BULLET     DENOMS    US$100K</p>
<p> RATING   *A+	    SALE LMTS  STANDARD   TAX PROV  --</p>
<p> NEG PLG  YES	    CRS DEF    YES	  FORCE MAJ YES</p>
<p> HOME CTRY S.KOREA     GOV LAW    ENGLISH    PAY DATE  27.FEB.97</p>
<p> NOTES    A+ (JAPAN CREDIT RATING AGENCY)</p>
<p> MGT LEVELS AND FEES   CO-LEAD MGR US$3-5 MLN 25 BP ALL-IN 65</p>
<p>LEAD MGR DAIWA SECURITIES HK</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2847 4039</p>
</text>
